          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili itaŋwa hidikuya nakuhuma, ejima adiŋi nawakwawu akata nyisoŋu yeŋi nayeŋi, hiyakumuletelawu; hakuyinaŋika makasindi wejima wawu, hakuyuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ademoni niwena hiyakufuma mudi antu amavulu nakukaloka nawu, Yeyi Mwana kaNzambi. Hakuyihoshola, hayiteja kuhoshaku, muloŋa amwilukili nawu diyi Kristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
